        <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Maintained VPS environments, managed security and performance configuration.</li>
          <li>Handled hardware troubleshooting and secure data formatting protocols.</li>
        </ul>
